The comprehensive employee project tracking system has been created as requested:

- Created three tables: employee_projects, project_assignments, and project_milestones in the employees schema.
- Added foreign key relationships to link assignments and milestones to projects and employees.
- Created indexes on project status, assignments (employee_id, project_id), and milestone due date.
- Inserted the specified initial data for projects, project assignments (based on employee department), and project milestones.
- Updated project statuses, budgets, and milestone completion as specified.
- Added a priority column to employee_projects with a check constraint and updated it per project.

If you need any further assistance or queries for this setup, please let me know!
